Package: flowcam
Type: Package
Title: Access USGS Stream Gage Camera Images via the NIMS API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Connor", "Brown", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ConnorBrown1996@gmail.com",
	comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9680-8930"))
Description: Provides functions to query camera metadata, list image filenames,
    build image URLs, download images, and assemble animated GIFs from the U.S.
    Geological Survey National Imagery Management System (NIMS) API
    <https://api.waterdata.usgs.gov/nims/v0>. Integrates with the
    'dataRetrieval' package <https://doi-usgs.github.io/dataRetrieval/> to
    enrich camera records with NWIS site metadata. Authentication via the
    API_USGS_PAT environment variable follows the same convention used by
    'dataRetrieval'.
